{"id":"5db9165df9c4fdf9","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-dirichlet-convolution.md","title":"Dirichlet Convolution","display":"df-dirichlet-convolution — Dirichlet Convolution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dirichlet-convolution","aliases":["58-df-dirichlet-convolution"],"display":"df-dirichlet-convolution — Dirichlet Convolution","depends_on":["[[58-df-arithmetic-function]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dirichlet-convolution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dirichlet-convolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dirichlet-convolution — Dirichlet Convolution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a8759d3e1558bf3\" href=\"?note=2a8759d3e1558bf3\" title=\"58-df-arithmetic-function\">58-df-arithmetic-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb{C}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (arithmetic functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S\\)</span> (arithmetic-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f*g\">\\(f*g\\)</span> (Dirichlet convolution)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}convolution} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land\\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(g)\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f*g,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},